  "priorExpiration": "2019-08-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2308.01 Application Requirements. Food service establishments applying for a license as a bed and breakfast facility shall comply with all of the application requirements of He-P 2304.01, except that they shall not be required to submit a plan review application as required under He-P 2304.01(a)(5) and wastewater items as required under He-P 2304.01(a)(4) and He-P 2304.07.\n\nSource. #6722, eff 3-27-98; ss by #7893, eff 5-21-03; ss by #9857-A, eff 2-1-11, EXPIRED: 2-1-19\n\nNew. #12729, INTERIM, eff 2-21-19, EXPIRES: 8-20-19; ss by #12852, eff 8-20-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2300.html"
